<h1>Account</h1>
<p>Logged in as <b><%= rodauth.account[:email] %></b>.</p>
<p><a href="/">← Back to your applications</a></p>
<h2 style="font-size:17px;margin:20px 0 6px">Your data</h2>
<p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 8px">Everything you've saved, except what's in Trash. The files aren't encrypted, so keep them somewhere safe.</p>
<ul style="margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:20px">
  <li><a href="/api/export/all.json" download>Everything (JSON)</a>: applications, referrals, company notes, prep library and resume versions</li>
  <li><a href="/api/export/applications.csv" download>Applications (CSV)</a>, for a spreadsheet</li>
  <li><a href="/api/export/referrals.csv" download>Referrals (CSV)</a></li>
</ul>
<div class="nav">
  <a href="<%= rodauth.change_password_path %>">Change password</a>
  <a href="<%= rodauth.close_account_path %>">Delete account</a>
</div>
<form method="post" action="<%= rodauth.logout_path %>" style="margin-top:16px">
  <%== rodauth.csrf_tag(rodauth.logout_path) %>
  <button type="submit">Log out</button>
</form>
